  "key_evidence": [
    "**Why it matters: the robotics-labs index scores the same company twice, under two names.** Halodi Robotics became 1X Technologies in 2023. The index lists 1X Technologies at 81.4 and Halodi Robotics at 62.5 — a gap of 18.9 points for one company.",
    "**The company's own website confirms the name change.** Its rebranding page, published 3 July 2023, reads: \"As part of an extensive rebranding initiative in 2023, Halodi Robotics unveils our new name.\"",
    "**No adverse conduct was located.** No lawsuits, safety incidents, labour findings or regulatory action were found. The fall from 62.5 to 25.0 is a measurement correction, not an accusation.",
    "**The privacy question around the NEO home robot is real but unresolved in public.** NEO relies on remote human operators who can see inside a customer's home. No primary consent policy or independent privacy review was located.",
    "**Roughly 37 of 40 scores rest on the absence of any published evidence.**"
  ],
